<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
		<title>Sluz v{$sluz_version} — Simple PHP templating engine</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Sluz v{$sluz_version} — Simple PHP templating engine with Smarty-like syntax">
		<link rel="icon" href='data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><text y="14" font-size="14">◈</text></svg>'>

		<link href="docs/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
		<script>{literal}try{var k='sluz-theme';var t=localStorage.getItem(k)||'dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-bs-theme',t);}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-bs-theme','dark');}{/literal}</script>

		{literal}
		<style>
			:root { --sluz-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace; }
			body { -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
			.navbar-brand { letter-spacing: .02em; font-weight: 700; }
			.code_file pre { font-family: var(--sluz-mono); font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.5; padding: .85rem 1rem; overflow-x: auto; background: transparent; }
			.card { box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.06); }
			.card-header { font-size: .85rem; letter-spacing: .01em; }
			[data-bs-theme="dark"] .code_file pre { background: #1a1d20; color: #e6edf3; border-color: #30363d !important; }
			[data-bs-theme="light"] .code_file pre { background: #f8f9fa; }
			.section-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.01em; padding:.6rem .85rem; margin-top:1.75rem; margin-bottom:.9rem; background:var(--bs-tertiary-bg); border:1px solid var(--bs-border-color); border-left-width:4px; border-radius:.45rem; box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.05); scroll-margin-top:4.5rem; }
			.section-heading:first-of-type { margin-top:0; }
			.section-heading .sh-icon { flex:0 0 auto; width:1.15em; height:1.15em; opacity:.95; }
			.section-heading .sh-text { flex:1 1 auto; }
			.section-heading .sh-anchor { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; opacity:.35; font-weight:400; font-size:.85em; }
			.section-heading:hover .sh-anchor { opacity:.85; }
			.sh-what { border-left-color: var(--bs-primary) !important; }
			.sh-req  { border-left-color: var(--bs-success) !important; }
			.sh-start{ border-left-color: var(--bs-warning) !important; }
			.sh-syntax{ border-left-color: var(--bs-info) !important; }
			.sh-naming{ border-left-color: #a78bfa !important; }
			[data-bs-theme="dark"] .section-heading { background:#1a1d20; border-color:#30363d; }
			[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sh-what { border-left-color:#82aaff !important; }
			[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sh-req { border-left-color:#7ec8a2 !important; }
			[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sh-start { border-left-color:#ffcb6b !important; }
			[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sh-syntax { border-left-color:#5eead4 !important; }
			[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sh-naming { border-left-color:#c4b5fd !important; }
		</style>
		{/literal}
	</head>
	<body>
	<nav class="navbar sticky-top bg-body-tertiary border-bottom shadow-sm">
		<div class="container-lg d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
			<div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
				<span class="navbar-brand mb-0 h1">Sluz <span class="badge text-bg-secondary align-middle fw-normal" style="font-size:.55em; letter-spacing:.04em;">v{$sluz_version}</span></span>
				<span class="text-body-secondary small d-none d-md-inline">Simple PHP templating engine</span>
			</div>
			<div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
				<button data-theme-toggle class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" type="button" aria-label="Toggle theme" title="Toggle theme" style="width: 3em;"><span data-theme-icon aria-hidden="true">☾</span></button>
				<a href="docs/" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" title="Documentation">Docs</a>
				<a href="docs/sandbox/" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm d-none d-sm-inline" title="Test out Sluz syntax in our sandbox">Sandbox</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/scottchiefbaker/sluz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm d-none d-sm-inline" title="Official GitHub project">GitHub</a>
				<a href="https://www.sluz.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Project homepage" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm d-none d-sm-inline">Sluz.org</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</nav>

	<div class="container-lg mt-4 mb-4">
		<h5 id="what-is-sluz" class="section-heading sh-what"><span class="sh-text">What is Sluz?</span><a href="#what-is-sluz" class="sh-anchor" aria-label="Permalink to What is Sluz">#</a></h5>

		<p>Sluz is a minimalistic PHP templating engine with an emphasis on syntax similar to <a href="https://www.smarty.net/">Smarty</a>. This allows you to separate your logic (<code>.php</code>) and your presentation (<code>.stpl</code>) files.</p>

		<p>The goal of Sluz is to be a <b>small</b>, single PHP source file, that emulates simple Smarty-like template syntax.</p>

		<h5 id="requirements" class="section-heading sh-req"><span class="sh-text">Requirements</span><a href="#requirements" class="sh-anchor" aria-label="Permalink to Requirements">#</a></h5>

		<p>Sluz requires PHP 8.x+. Sluz is a zero-dependency library. Only the <code>sluz.class.php</code> file is needed for the library to function.</p>

		<h5 id="getting-started" class="section-heading sh-start"><span class="sh-text">Getting started</span><a href="#getting-started" class="sh-anchor" aria-label="Permalink to Getting started">#</a></h5>

		<p>Download Sluz from <a href="https://github.com/scottchiefbaker/sluz">GitHub</a> and extract on your server.</p>

		<div class="code_file">
			<code class="mb-1">File: <b>script.php</b></code>
			<pre class="border p-2">include('/path/to/sluz/sluz.class.php');
$s = new sluz();

$s->assign("name", "Jason");
$s->assign("version", "{$sluz_version}");

print $s->fetch("tpls/script.stpl");</pre>

			{literal}
			<div class="code_file mt-3">
				<code class="mb-1">File: <b>tpls/script.stpl</b></code>
				<pre class="border p-2">&lt;h1&gt;Hello {$name}&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;div&gt;Welcome to Sluz version: {$version}&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
			</div>
			{/literal}
		</div>

		<h5 id="template-syntax" class="section-heading sh-syntax"><span class="sh-text">Template Syntax</span><a href="#template-syntax" class="sh-anchor" aria-label="Permalink to Template Syntax">#</a></h5>

		<div class="table-responsive">
			<table class="table table-bordered table-striped table-sm">
				<thead class="table-dark">
					<tr>
						<th>Syntax</th>
						<th>Example</th>
						<th>Output</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					{literal}
					<tr><td><code>{$var}</code></td><td><code>{$name}</code></td><td><code>Jason</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{$hash.key}</code> / <code>{$array.0}</code></td><td><code>{$cust.first}</code></td><td><code>Scott</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{$var|modifier}</code></td><td><code>{$animal|strtoupper}</code></td><td><code>KITTEN</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{$var|mod:params}</code></td><td><code>{$greet|substr:0,3}</code></td><td><code>Hel</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{$var|m1|m2}</code></td><td><code>{$word|strtolower|ucfirst}</code></td><td><code>Crazy</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{$var|default:"val"}</code></td><td><code>{$null|default:"?"}</code></td><td><code>?</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{$expr}</code></td><td><code>{$number + 3}</code></td><td><code>18</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{if}…{elseif}…{else}…{/if}</code></td><td><code>{if $x}yes{else}no{/if}</code></td><td><code>yes</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{foreach $a as $v}</code></td><td><code>{foreach $items as $x}{$x}{/foreach}</code></td><td><code>onetwothree</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{foreach $a as $k => $v}</code></td><td><code>{foreach $m as $k=>$v}{$k}{/foreach}</code></td><td><code>012</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>$__FOREACH_FIRST/LAST/INDEX</code></td><td><code>{if $__FOREACH_FIRST}…{/if}</code></td><td>—</td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{include file='...'}</code></td><td><code>{include file='header.stpl'}</code></td><td>—</td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{literal}…{/literal}</code></td><td><code>{literal}function foo() { {/literal}</code></td><td><code>function foo() { </code></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{* comment *}</code></td><td><code>{* hidden *}</code></td><td><em>(empty)</em></td></tr>
					<tr><td><code>{function()}</code></td><td><code>{count($array)}</code></td><td><code>3</code></td></tr>
					{/literal}
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<h5 id="naming" class="section-heading sh-naming"><span class="sh-text">Naming</span><a href="#naming" class="sh-anchor" aria-label="Permalink to Naming">#</a></h5>
		<p>Sluz is pronounced "slooz". The name comes from the "S" in Smarty and "luz" which is Spanish for light. Sluz is a lite, Smarty-like templating system.</p>

		<div class="row">
			<div class="col">
			</div>
			<div class="col text-end">
				<a href="unit_tests/tests.php">Run unit tests</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<footer class="text-center text-body-secondary small mt-5 pt-3 border-top">
			sluz v{$sluz_version} — <a href="https://github.com/scottchiefbaker/sluz" class="link-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> · <a href="docs/" class="link-secondary">Docs</a> · <a href="docs/sandbox/" class="link-secondary">Sandbox</a> · <a href="https://www.sluz.org" class="link-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sluz.org</a>
		</footer>
	</div>

	<script src="docs/js/theme.js"></script>
	</body>
</html>
